  "description": "Lycia.Persistence.Redis provides the Redis-backed SagaStore for the Lycia Saga framework:\n            - RedisSagaStore implementing ISagaStore (step log, saga data) and IVersionedSagaStore (optimistic concurrency)\n            - Atomic Redis Lua-script based CAS for saga step transitions and versioned saga-data writes\n            - Redis connection registration driven by explicit DSL configuration (WithRedisSagaStore)",
